invalid type: string "B. Tech. Regulation, 2024 APJ Abdul Kalam Technological University 70 Programmes: All applicable government and AICTE orders issued from time to time shall be binding on student exchange programmes. 23. Internships at KTU R 23.1 Students at KTU are permitted to undertake two types of internships: 1. Short-Term Internships 2. Long-Term Internships. R 23.2 Short-Term Internship